@startuml 使用案例4_3_醫療紀錄驗證
title 使用案例4.3: 醫療紀錄驗證流程

actor "管理員" as Admin
participant "MedicalRecords.vue" as MedicalPage
participant "medicalRecords.ts" as MedicalAPI
participant "medical_records.py(blueprint)" as MedicalBlueprint
participant "medical_record_service.py" as MedicalService
participant "medical_record.py(model)" as MedicalModel
participant "user.py(model)" as UserModel
database "MySQL" as DB

== 1. 進入醫療紀錄管理頁面 ==
Admin -> MedicalPage: 訪問「/medical-records」路由
activate MedicalPage
MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: onMounted()\n初始化頁面
MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: isAdmin = computed(() => \nauthStore.user?.role === 'ADMIN')
note right
  isAdmin computed:
  - 計算當前用戶是否為管理員
  - 用於控制驗證按鈕的顯示
  - 所有角色都可進入此頁面
end note

== 2. 載入動物列表 ==
MedicalPage -> MedicalAPI: getAnimalsForMedicalRecords()
activate MedicalAPI
note right
  GET /medical-records/animals:
  - 帶篩選參數的動物列表 API
  - 管理員可看到所有動物
  - 一般會員/收容所會員看到可管理的動物
  - 與 4.1 流程相同
end note
MedicalAPI -> MedicalBlueprint: GET /medical-records/animals\n(JWT Token + 篩選參數)
activate MedicalBlueprint
MedicalBlueprint --> MedicalAPI: 200 OK {animals[]}
deactivate MedicalBlueprint
MedicalAPI --> MedicalPage: {animals[], total}
deactivate MedicalAPI

== 3. 選擇動物並載入醫療紀錄 ==
Admin -> MedicalPage: 點選動物卡片
MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: selectAnimal(animal)\nselectedAnimal = animal
MedicalPage -> MedicalAPI: getMedicalRecords(animal_id)
activate MedicalAPI
note right
  與 4.2 流程相同
  載入該動物的所有醫療紀錄
end note
MedicalAPI -> MedicalBlueprint: GET /medical-records/animals/{id}/medical-records
activate MedicalBlueprint
MedicalBlueprint --> MedicalAPI: 200 OK {medical_records[]}
deactivate MedicalBlueprint
MedicalAPI --> MedicalPage: {total, medical_records[]}
deactivate MedicalAPI

== 4. 顯示醫療紀錄清單 ==
MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: records = response.medical_records
MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 渲染醫療紀錄清單
note right
  每筆紀錄顯示:
  - record_type (類型徽章)
  - date (紀錄時間)
  - provider (醫療提供者)
  - details (詳細說明)
  - attachments[] (證明文件)
  - verified (驗證狀態)
  
  驗證按鈕顯示控制:
  - v-if="isAdmin" 條件渲染
  - 只有管理員能看到驗證按鈕
  - 建立者看到編輯按鈕 (canEditRecord)
end note

loop 每筆醫療紀錄
    alt isAdmin && verified === false
        MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 顯示「✓ 驗證」按鈕\n(綠色)
    else isAdmin && verified === true
        MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 顯示「✗ 撤銷驗證」按鈕\n(紅色)
        MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 顯示驗證標章 ✓
    end
end

MedicalPage --> Admin: 顯示醫療紀錄清單\n(含驗證按鈕)
deactivate MedicalPage

== 5. 管理員檢視醫療紀錄內容 ==
Admin -> MedicalPage: 檢視醫療紀錄詳情
activate MedicalPage
MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 顯示完整資訊
note right
  管理員檢視內容:
  - 紀錄類型
  - 紀錄日期
  - 醫療提供者
  - 詳細說明
  - 醫療證明文件
  - 當前驗證狀態
  - 創建者資訊
end note

Admin -> Admin: 檢視醫療證明文件\n(attachments[])
Admin -> Admin: 評估醫療紀錄真實性
deactivate MedicalPage

== 6. 點擊驗證按鈕 ==
Admin -> MedicalPage: 點擊「✓ 驗證」或「✗ 撤銷驗證」
activate MedicalPage
MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: handleVerify(recordId, verified)
note right
  verified 參數:
  - true: 驗證通過
  - false: 撤銷驗證
end note

== 7. 發送驗證請求 ==
MedicalPage -> MedicalAPI: verifyMedicalRecord(recordId, verified)
activate MedicalAPI
MedicalAPI -> MedicalBlueprint: POST /medical-records/{id}/verify\n{verified: true/false}\n(JWT Token)
activate MedicalBlueprint

== 8. 驗證 JWT Token 並解析請求 ==
MedicalBlueprint -> MedicalBlueprint: @jwt_required()\nget_jwt_identity()
MedicalBlueprint -> MedicalBlueprint: current_user_id = int(JWT user_id)
note right
  JWT Token 驗證:
  - 提取 user_id
  - 轉換為 int 類型
  - 用於後續管理員權限檢查
end note
MedicalBlueprint -> MedicalBlueprint: 解析請求體\nverified = data.get('verified', True)

== 9. 檢查管理員權限 ==
MedicalBlueprint -> MedicalService: verify_medical_record(\nrecord_id, current_user_id, verified)
activate MedicalService
MedicalService -> UserModel: db.session.get(User, current_user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id = :current_user_id
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: user 資料
deactivate DB
UserModel --> MedicalService: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

MedicalService -> MedicalService: 檢查 user.role == UserRole.ADMIN
alt user is None OR user.role != ADMIN
    MedicalService --> MedicalBlueprint: raise PermissionDeniedError
    MedicalBlueprint --> MedicalAPI: 403 Forbidden
    MedicalAPI --> MedicalPage: Error: 權限不足
    MedicalPage --> Admin: ❌ 操作失敗，請重試
else user.role == ADMIN
    note right
      管理員權限確認通過
    end note
end

== 10. 查詢醫療紀錄 ==
MedicalService -> MedicalModel: MedicalRecord.query.filter_by(\nmedical_record_id, deleted_at=None)
activate MedicalModel
MedicalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM medical_records\nWHERE medical_record_id = :id\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> MedicalModel: medical_record 資料
deactivate DB
MedicalModel --> MedicalService: MedicalRecord 物件
deactivate MedicalModel

alt record is None
    MedicalService --> MedicalBlueprint: raise NotFoundError
    MedicalBlueprint --> MedicalAPI: 404 Not Found
    MedicalAPI --> MedicalPage: Error: 紀錄不存在
    MedicalPage --> Admin: ❌ 操作失敗，請重試
end

== 11. 更新驗證狀態 ==
MedicalService -> MedicalService: record.verified = verified
alt verified == True (驗證通過)
    MedicalService -> MedicalService: record.verified_by = current_user_id
    note right
      驗證通過:
      - verified = True
      - verified_by = 管理員 user_id
    end note
else verified == False (撤銷驗證)
    MedicalService -> MedicalService: record.verified_by = None
    note right
      撤銷驗證:
      - verified = False
      - verified_by = None
    end note
end
MedicalService -> MedicalService: record.updated_at = datetime.utcnow()
note right
  updated_at 時間戳:
  - SQLAlchemy 會自動更新
  - 記錄最後修改時間
end note

== 12. 提交資料庫變更 ==
MedicalService -> MedicalModel: db.session.commit()
activate MedicalModel
MedicalModel -> DB: UPDATE medical_records\nSET verified = :verified,\nverified_by = :verified_by,\nupdated_at = :updated_at\nWHERE medical_record_id = :id
activate DB
DB --> MedicalModel: 更新成功
deactivate DB
MedicalModel --> MedicalService: commit 成功
deactivate MedicalModel

MedicalService --> MedicalBlueprint: MedicalRecord 物件
deactivate MedicalService

== 13. 回傳驗證結果 ==
MedicalBlueprint -> MedicalBlueprint: 組裝回應資料
MedicalBlueprint --> MedicalAPI: 200 OK\n{message, medical_record}
deactivate MedicalBlueprint
MedicalAPI --> MedicalPage: {message, medical_record}
deactivate MedicalAPI

== 14. 更新前端顯示 ==
MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 更新本地紀錄狀態
note right
  前端狀態更新:
  1. 找到對應 recordIndex
  2. records[recordIndex].verified = verified
  3. records[recordIndex].verified_by = admin_id 或 null
end note

MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 更新驗證按鈕樣式
alt verified === true
    MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 按鈕變更為「✗ 撤銷驗證」(紅色)
    MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 顯示驗證標章 ✓ (綠色)
else verified === false
    MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 按鈕變更為「✓ 驗證」(綠色)
    MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 移除驗證標章
end

MedicalPage -> MedicalPage: 顯示成功訊息
MedicalPage --> Admin: 顯示驗證成功訊息
deactivate MedicalPage

== 15. 驗證標章顯示效果 ==
note over Admin, DB
  **驗證標章顯示規則:**
  
  在動物詳情頁:
  - 已驗證紀錄: 顯示綠色 ✓ 標記
  - 未驗證紀錄: 顯示灰色 ? 標記
  
  在醫療紀錄管理頁:
  - 管理員可看到所有紀錄
  - 已驗證: 顯示 ✓ 標章
  - 未驗證: 無標章
end note

== 16. 錯誤處理情境 ==
note over Admin, DB
  **可能的錯誤情境:**
  
  1. 權限錯誤 (403): 非管理員無法驗證
  2. 紀錄不存在 (404): 紀錄已刪除或 ID 錯誤
  3. 網路錯誤 (500): 資料庫連線失敗
  4. JWT Token 錯誤 (401): Token 過期或無效
end note

note over Admin, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 醫療紀錄驗證狀態已更新
  2. verified_by 欄位記錄驗證者 user_id
  3. updated_at 時間戳已更新
  4. 前端顯示即時更新
  5. 驗證標章正確顯示
  
  **管理員角色定位 (重要):**
  - 管理員不能創建醫療紀錄 (canManageSelectedAnimal 對 ADMIN 返回 false)
  - 管理員不能編輯醫療紀錄內容 (canEditRecord 對 ADMIN 返回 false)
  - 管理員只能驗證/撤銷驗證醫療紀錄
  - 管理員的角色是驗證記錄真實性，而非修改內容
  - 確保醫療記錄的專業性和責任歸屬
  
  **驗證操作權限:**
  - 僅管理員可執行驗證操作 (user.role == ADMIN)
  - 管理員可查看所有動物的醫療紀錄
  - 管理員可隨時驗證/撤銷驗證
  - 前端通過 isAdmin computed 控制按鈕顯示
  
  **資料一致性:**
  - verified = true 時，verified_by 必須有值
  - verified = false 時，verified_by 為 NULL
  - updated_at 記錄最後修改時間
  - 驗證狀態變更不影響原始紀錄內容
end note

@enduml
